🧠 ENGINE ARCHITECTURE OVERVIEW (Python Side)

The engine will consist of:

main.py                → entry point
config_loader.py       → loads YAML config
db_connector.py        → DB abstraction (engine + source + target)
execution_engine.py    → core execution lifecycle
rule_executor.py       → executes SQL rules
scoring_engine.py      → computes batch score
logger.py              → structured logging


We start with a clean skeleton that:

Creates execution batch

Loops controls sequentially

Loads rules for each control

Executes SQL template

Logs results

Stores defects

Calculates score

Finalises batch